    "Description": "WebKitGTK is the port of the portable web rendering engine WebKit to the GTK platform.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-86922)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2026-86985)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-112655)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112654)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112615)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-112623)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-112639)\n\n* webkitgtk: A remote attacker may be able to break out of Web Content sandbox (CVE-2026-113897)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to memory corruption (CVE-2026-86974)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2026-112684)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112666)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected Safari crash (CVE-2026-86986)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112686)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2026-112599)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112673)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2026-113904)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-112637)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected Safari crash (CVE-2026-112693)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2026-86973)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112653)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to unexpected memory modification (CVE-2026-113903)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-112651)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to memory corruption (CVE-2026-112640)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process crash (CVE-2026-113901)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to arbitrary code execution (CVE-2026-112626)\n\n* webkitgtk: Processing maliciously crafted web content may lead to an unexpected process termination (CVE-2026-112695)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Information leak in Skia (CVE-2026-126920)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-126848)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-126857)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Uninitialized resource in ANGLE (CVE-2026-126870)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-126844)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Integer overflow in Skia (CVE-2026-126876)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Information leak in Skia (CVE-2026-126882)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-126841)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-126898)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-126884)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-126914)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-126853)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-126922)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-126894)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Buffer overflow in Skia (CVE-2026-126912)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Use after free in ANGLE (CVE-2026-126842)\n\n* chromium-browser: Out of bounds write in ANGLE (CVE-2026-130996)\n\n* chromium-browser: Out of bounds read in ANGLE (CVE-2026-131099)\n\n* chromium-browser: Out of bounds read in ANGLE (CVE-2026-131025)\n\n* chromium-browser: Out of bounds write in ANGLE (CVE-2026-130971)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Out of bounds write in ANGLE (CVE-2026-131054)\n\n* chromium-browser: Buffer overflow in Skia (CVE-2026-131013)\n\n* chromium-browser: Incorrect reference resolution in ANGLE (CVE-2026-130954)\n\n* webkitgtk: webkitgtk: out-of-bounds read in UIProcess via mismatched DMABufBufferAttributes plane vectors (CVE-2026-135055)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
